note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note apps/omega-zk/gate_zk.om
note Pure Seeded-OM-2 Verification Gate for Wave 4 omega-zk (Goldilocks Fiat-Shamir STARK / FRI).
note
note Compose after:
note   si/directives/om2.om seed/ng/sha256.om apps/omega-zk/gate_zk.om
note
note Usage:
note   gate_zk OMC_BIN REPO_ROOT SCRATCH_DIR   (pin check + 2x det build + positive + 14 attack controls + 5 OMC mutants)
note   gate_zk STARK_BIN SCRATCH_DIR           (positive + container/CLI attack controls on existing binary)
note
note Zero C, zero Python, zero Rust, zero gcc, zero GPU device writes (hw_writes=0).

const ZG_OK int 0
const ZG_ERR_ARG int 1
const ZG_ERR_PIN int 69
const GL_P ulong 0xffffffff00000001
const ZK_PROOF_BYTES ulong 44408

global zg_omc uchar 1024
global zg_omc_l ulong 1
